  "notable_quotes": [
    "Using metal-cluster SBUs as mononodes, combined with linker variation or pre-functionalization, is presented as an efficient route to porous and functionalized MOFs.",
    "The higher CO2 uptake of MAC-4-OH is attributed to electrostatic attractive interactions introduced by channel hydroxyl groups.",
    "In MAC-4, dmtrz ligands and a μ3-OH bridge form a trinuclear-triangular [Zn3(dmtrz)3(OH)(O2C)2] secondary building unit."
